                        </div>
                        <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">The testing agent maintained action history and structured evidence as work progressed, reducing reporting gaps and making review faster.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="trust-card-no-hover group transition-colors">
                        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
